{"text": "The longest relationship of your life is not your marriage. It is not your friendships. It is not even the one with your parents.\n\nIt is the one with your brother, or your sister. Before money, before heartbreak, before success, before the masks you wear today \u2014 they were already there.\n\nThe same kitchen. The same childhood home. The same parents on their worst day. They are the only other person alive who remembers the house the way you remember it.\n\nAnd yet this is the person most people speak to least. You will call a friend you met five years ago before you call the one who watched you become who you are. Do not let silence become the habit. Silence is not peace. Silence is only distance that nobody chose out loud.\n\nComment sibling, and I will send you what to say first.\n\nSending one message is easy. Staying in someone's life when you are both tired is the harder practice. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "l", "o", "n", "g", "e", "s", "t", " ", "r", "e", "l", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", "s", "h", "i", "p", " ", "o", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "l", "i", "f", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "m", "a", "r", "r", "i", "a", "g", "e", ".", " ", "I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "f", "r", "i", "e", "n", "d", "s", "h", "i", "p", "s", ".", " ", "I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "p", "a", "r", "e", "n", "t", "s", ".", "\n", "\n", "I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "b", "r", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", ",", " ", "o", "r", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "s", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "B", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", " ", "m", "o", "n", "e", "y", ",", " ",